        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia D9000SA, Single Cylinder Square Stainless Steel Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Square Stainless Steel Single Cylinder Deadbolt was made for those hoping to update their space with modern door hardware. A single cylinder deadbolt, the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. The Omnia D9000SA Single Cylinder Square Stainless Steel Deadbolt has a brushed stainless steel finish. It will fit most standard predrilled doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-Tribeca-Sizes.jpg?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"232\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia D9000SA Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/square-stainless-steel-double-cylinder-deadbolt-omnia-d9000sac\"><b>Omnia D9000SAC Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Square Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>High security 1\" deadbolt with hardened steel core.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit most standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Package Includes: 1 cylinders with collar, 1 thumbturn, deadbolt assembly, faceplate, reinforced armored strike with 3\" long screws, and dust box.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Square Brushed Stainless Steel Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Interior Length: 2-5/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Interior Overall Projection: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Thumbturn Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Length: 2-3/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
