                "description": "The Square Stainless Steel Single Cylinder Deadbolt was made for those hoping to update their space with modern door hardware. A single cylinder deadbolt, the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. The Omnia D9000SA Single Cylinder Square Stainless Steel Deadbolt has a brushed stainless steel finish. It will fit most standard predrilled doors.\r\n",
